# core.autocrlf=true is set globally on this machine. If entrypoint.sh ever
# reaches the image with CRLF line endings, the container dies at startup with
# "no such file or directory" — pointing at the shebang, not at the real cause,
# which makes it a genuinely nasty half-hour to debug. Pin it.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
